<title>HONG KONG: New World Infra acquires De Sheng Power.</title>
<headline>New World Infra acquires De Sheng Power.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>New World Infrastructure Ltd said it is acquiring a controlling interest in a power plant project in China.</p>
<p>New World Infrastructure said in a statement published on Thursday that it would acquire a 60 percent interest in Shunde De Sheng Power Plant Co Ltd for US$51.74 million from third party Talent Classic Enterprise Ltd.</p>
<p>Shunde De Sheng is a Sino-foreign equity joint venture held currently 70 percent by Talent Classic and 30 percent by Shunde Electric Development Co.</p>
